[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0024","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2996","title":"SysAid Help Desk 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SysAid Help Desk 15.2 之前版本存在多处目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 getGfiUpgradeFile 接口的 fileName 参数传递 `..`（点点）序列实现任意文件读取，或向 calculateRdsFileChecksum 接口的 fileName 参数传递 `..` 序列触发 CPU 与内存资源耗尽导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SysAid Help Desk 全线版本，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2996"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-06-08T14:59:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:07Z","remediation":"建议升级 SysAid Help Desk 至 15.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置访问控制规则，对 getGfiUpgradeFile 和 calculateRdsFileChecksum 接口的 fileName 参数进行路径合法性校验，过滤 ../ 序列，并限制 Web 应用对敏感目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132138/SysAid-Help-Desk-14.4-Code-Execution-Denial-Of-Service-Traversal-SQL-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Jun/8","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/535679/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75038","https://www.sysaid.com/blog/entry/sysaid-15-2-your-voice-your-service-desk","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2996.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2996.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2996.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2996.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Akokonunes/Private-Nuclei-Templates/blob/f92d2274458a958ed01345915693cf1dbe026f83/LFI/CVE-2015-2996.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/77377e28faad177d228a3e5b0fbe2f2b78a866b0/api/2015/CVE-2015-2996.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2996_3.yaml","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fbf04475-f9b5-4d61-a5b4-73068e2993b3.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2996_25.yaml","https://github.com/vulsio/msfdb-list/blob/210e2cbc4d3da3514332a11f1d50088ff3bc397f/rapid7/2015/CVE-2015-2997.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0030","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4050","title":"Symfony HttpKernel ESI未授权访问漏洞","description":"Symfony 框架 HttpKernel 组件中的 FragmentListener 在启用 ESI 或 SSI 支持时，未正确校验 _controller 属性是否已设置，导致远程攻击者可通过向 /_fragment 端点发送不含哈希值或包含无效哈希值的特制请求，绕过 URL 签名验证和安全规则限制，实现未授权访问内部路由。该漏洞影响 Symfony 2.3.19 至 2.3.28、2.4.9 至 2.4.10、2.5.4 至 2.5.11 及 2.6.0 至 2.6.7 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4050"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-06-02T14:59:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:41Z","remediation":"升级 Symfony 至 2.3.29、2.4.11、2.5.12 或 2.6.8 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 FragmentListener 未校验 _controller 属性的问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 ESI/SSI 支持（设置 `fragments.path` 为不可访问路径），或在 Web 服务器层面对 `/_fragment` 路径添加 IP 白名单或认证访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-June/159513.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-June/159603.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-June/159610.html","http://symfony.com/blog/cve-2015-4050-esi-unauthorized-access","http://www.debian.org/security/2015/dsa-3276","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74928","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4050.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4050.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4050.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-4050/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-4050.py","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-4050.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2015-4050-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-40xx/CVE-2015-4050.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2015/gb_fedora_2015_9025_php-symfony_fc20.nasl","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-4050_1_1.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4050_19.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4050.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0506","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4068","title":"Arcserve Unified Data Protection 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Arcserve Unified Data Protection是VMware公司的一款综合数据保护解决方案。2015-4068 号目录遍历漏洞存在于 Arcserve UDP 5.0 更新版4 之前版本中。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程向 reportFileServlet 或 exportServlet servlet 提交特制文件路径，利用目录遍历缺陷访问系统敏感文件或清空重要数据，导致信息泄露或服务中断。漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.1，等级极高，对企业的IT系统构成严重威胁。该漏洞主要影响使用旧版 Arcserve UDP 的企业用户，攻击者可通过简单的网络请求实现敏感信息获取或系统破坏，目前该漏洞已得到修复。\"\"\"\n```\n\nWait, there's a problem here. The TOML shows `description = \"\"\"tags` followed by a comment block, and then `<value>...","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4068"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-05-29T15:59:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Arcserve Unified Data Protection 5.0 Update 4 或更高版本以获取官方补丁。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙上配置访问控制策略，仅允许授权用户访问 reportFileServlet 和 exportServlet 端点，并部署 WAF 规则过滤目录遍历攻击流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://documentation.arcserve.com/Arcserve-UDP/Available/V5/ENU/Bookshelf_Files/HTML/Update%204/UDP_Update4_ReleaseNotes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74845","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-15-241/","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-15-242/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-4068","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-4068.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4068.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4068","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4068.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4068.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-4068/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-4068.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-4068.html","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2015.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2015/CVE-2015-4068.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0506.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0506.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0035","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4127","title":"WordPress church_admin 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 church_admin 插件 0.810 版本之前存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 `address` 参数向页面注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。当管理员或用户访问特制的 URL（如 `index.php/2015/05/21/church_admin-registration-form/`）时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息泄露等危害。该漏洞影响 church_admin 0.809 及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4127"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-28T14:59:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:47Z","remediation":"立即将 church_admin 插件升级到 0.810 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台插件编辑器中删除或重命名 church_admin 插件目录，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则过滤 address 参数中的恶意 HTML/JavaScript 字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132034/WordPress-Church-Admin-0.800-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://www.osvdb.org/121304","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74782","https://wordpress.org/plugins/church-admin/changelog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37112/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37112","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4127.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4127.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4127.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4127","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-4127-church_admin-54e7ccaf-2b16-4e36-a8ec-8f1f61193ffd.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4127-4b73eabc9d317f4a21bdab82c239570b.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4127_3.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d3a8c63a8928adbc02a757ccf94c45318263469f/2015/CVE-2015-4127.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4127.rules","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/Artifact/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0032","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4063","title":"WordPress NewStatPress 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 NewStatPress 插件 0.9.9 之前版本中的 includes/nsp_search.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 wp-admin/admin.php 页面的 nsp_search 功能提交特制的 where1 参数，注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时脚本被执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 NewStatPress 0.9.8 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 3.5，危害等级低，利用需用户认证且需用户交互。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4063"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-27T18:59:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:42Z","remediation":"The user wants me to generate a remediation field for CVE-2015-4063. This is a WordPress plugin (NewStatPress) XSS vulnerability. The fix is to upgrade to version 0.9.9 or later. Let me provide a specific, actionable remediation in Chinese.<value>立即将 NewStatPress 插件升级至 0.9.9 或更高版本（WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 安装插件 → 搜索 NewStatPress → 更新）。如无法升级，在 wp-admin/admin.php 的 nsp_search 页面中对 where1 参数进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，或在 WordPress 函数库中添加 add_filter('nsp_search_where1', 'esc_html') 临时缓解。同时限制可信用户对管理后台的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132038/WordPress-NewStatPress-0.9.8-Cross-Site-Scripting-SQL-Injection.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74773","https://wordpress.org/plugins/newstatpress/changelog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37107/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37107","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4063.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4063.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4063.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4063","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4063.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4063_1.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-4063.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4063.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2015/CVE-2015-4063.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-40xx/CVE-2015-4063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0031","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4062","title":"WordPress NewStatPress 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 NewStatPress 插件 0.9.8 及之前版本中 includes/nsp_search.php 文件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。已登录认证的攻击者可通过向 wp-admin/admin.php 页面提交 nsp_search 请求，在 where1 参数中注入恶意的 SQL 语句，从而执行任意 SQL 命令，导致数据库中的敏感信息泄露、数据篡改甚至完全控制数据库。该漏洞仅需低权限认证即可远程利用，影响所有使用受影响版本插件的 WordPress 站点。建议用户立即升级至 0.9.9 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4062"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-27T18:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:42Z","remediation":"立即将 NewStatPress 插件升级到 0.9.9 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 wp-admin/admin.php 的 nsp_search 页面中对 where1 参数添加严格的输入过滤和参数化查询，或临时禁用该插件。同时建议限制后台用户权限，仅授予可信用户管理员访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132038/WordPress-NewStatPress-0.9.8-Cross-Site-Scripting-SQL-Injection.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74773","https://wordpress.org/plugins/newstatpress/changelog/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37107/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4062.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4062.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4062.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4062","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4062.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4062_1.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-4062.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2015/CVE-2015-4062.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4062-73e3cc60230a4d4c851c5aabcc37ca3d.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-40xx/CVE-2015-4062.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0026","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3306","title":"ProFTPd ProFTPD mod_copy 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.3.5 的 mod_copy 模块存在未授权任意文件读写漏洞。该模块提供的 SITE CPFR 和 SITE CPTO 命令未对用户身份进行有效验证，导致未经认证的远程攻击者可通过 FTP 协议直接向目标服务器发送特制的 SITE CPFR 和 SITE CPTO 命令，实现任意文件复制操作。攻击者可将恶意文件（如 Web Shell、SSH 公钥）写入目标服务器任意目录，或读取敏感配置文件，进而获取服务器完全控制权。该漏洞影响所有运行 ProFTPD 1.3.5 且启用了 mod_copy 模块的服务器，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3306"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-18T15:59:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 ProFTPD 至 1.3.5a 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在配置文件中移除或注释 `LoadModule mod_copy.c` 行以禁用 mod_copy 模块，并在防火墙限制对 FTP 服务（默认端口 21）的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-May/157053.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-May/157054.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-May/157581.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2015-06/msg00020.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131505/ProFTPd-1.3.5-File-Copy.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131555/ProFTPd-1.3.5-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131567/ProFTPd-CPFR-CPTO-Proof-Of-Concept.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132218/ProFTPD-1.3.5-Mod_Copy-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162777/ProFTPd-1.3.5-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2015/dsa-3263","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/unix/ftp/proftpd_modcopy_exec","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74238","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36742/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36803/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36803","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3306.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-3306.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-3306.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/network/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3306.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-3306-2503.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/76729d36853c2b419aa6a67b7435e9a2c529ac8e/data/2015/CVE-2015-3306-shk0x_cpx_proftpd.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-3306","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/cve-2015-3306.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/08a0a113f824c9be59af17ee627c8b7e6b2cc19b/2015/CVE-2015-3306.json","https://github.com/ffffffff0x/1earn/blob/4b34dd1f150b45a82b8830aa1e737ba370f8c015/1earn/Security/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90/%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA/VulnHub/symfonos/symfonos2-WalkThrough.md","https://github.com/cqr-cryeye-forks/goby-pocs/blob/ffef890592ee0c35c94a148c9f7b96b8728036d4/ProFTPD-1.3.5-mod_copy-File-Write-(CVE-2015-3306).json","https://github.com/t0kx/exploit-CVE-2015-3306","https://github.com/nootropics/propane","https://github.com/xyk0x/cpx_proftpd","https://github.com/davidtavarez/CVE-2015-3306","https://github.com/cd6629/CVE-2015-3306-Python-PoC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0111","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1671","title":"Microsoft Windows DirectWrite TrueType字体远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows DirectWrite 库在解析特制 TrueType 字体文件时存在内存损坏漏洞，远程攻击者可诱导用户打开嵌入恶意字体的文档或网页，触发内存损坏实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 .NET Framework 3.0 SP2/3.5/3.5.1/4/4.5/4.5.1/4.5.2、Office 2007 SP3/2010 SP2、Live Meeting 2007、Lync 2010/2013、Silverlight 5 等多个产品。攻击需要用户交互（如打开恶意文档或访问恶意网页），攻击成功可在当前用户权限下执行任意代码，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（高危）。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，且 CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1671"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-05-13T10:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2015 年 5 月安全更新 (MS15-056 / KB3057159 等对应补丁)，将 .NET Framework 升级至 3.0 SP2 及以上修补版本、3.5/3.5.1/4/4.5/4.5.1/4.5.2 安装对应安全补丁；Office 2007 升级至 SP3 并安装 KB3054852，Office 2010 升级至 SP2 并安装 KB3054853；Lync 2010/2013 升级至最新累积更新；Silverlight 5 升级至 5.1.40416.00 或更高版本；Live Meeting 2007 Console 安装 KB3055041。临时缓解：在防火墙层面阻止不可信字体文件加载，禁用 Web 浏览器中字体下载功能，限制非受信任文档打开。启用 Microsoft Update 自动更新确保后续补丁及时安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74490","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032281","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-044","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1671","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1671.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/eae7ac0ecf3ee3e622251b26a01cbfaff8bc97ef/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2015-1671.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1671.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2015-1671/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2015-1671.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-1671","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2515f07573bc23c1f79f0d197a09a6f29d3e20ae/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1671.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-1671.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-1671.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-1671-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0012","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1880","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSLVPN 登录页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 5.2.0至5.2.2版本的SSLVPN登录页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入参数未进行充分的过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统SSLVPN登录页面提交特制的恶意请求，注入任意Web脚本或HTML代码。当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的登录页面时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如会话令牌窃取）。攻击者无需身份认证，但需要诱使用户访问恶意构造的链接。Fortinet已在FortiOS 5.2.3版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1880"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-12T19:59:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:09Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 5.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SSLVPN 登录页面的跨站脚本注入问题。如无法立即升级，可在 FortiGate 上配置 Web 过滤策略，对 SSLVPN 登录页面的输入参数进行严格校验，并启用 HTTP Content-Security-Policy 头以缓解 XSS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-15-005/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74652","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032261","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032262","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032264","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032265","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1880.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1880.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1880.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-1880/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-1880.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2015-1880.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-1880-2476.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-1880.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-1880-2478.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-1880.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/09/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1880.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0027","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3337","title":"Elasticsearch site插件目录遍历与文件读取漏洞","description":"ElasticSearch 在 1.4.5 之前及 1.5.2 之前的 1.5.x 版本中，当启用 site 插件时存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 ElasticSearch 服务发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 site 插件对路径过滤不严的缺陷，实现跨目录读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件）。该漏洞危害等级中危，CVSS 评分 4.3，攻击复杂度较高（需启用 site 插件），但无需身份认证即可利用。官方已在 1.4.5 和 1.5.2 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3337"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-05-01T15:59:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:45Z","remediation":"升级 Elasticsearch 至 1.4.5 或 1.5.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用所有 site 插件（删除 plugins 目录下非必要插件），或在反向代理层配置规则拦截包含 `../` 的 URL 路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131646/Elasticsearch-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2015/dsa-3241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/535385","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74353","https://www.elastic.co/community/security","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37054/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37054","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3337.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-3337.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/elasticsearch/CVE-2015-3337/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-3337.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3337.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-3337-2511.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/elasticsearch-cve-2015-3337-lfi.yml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2015-3337.js","https://github.com/pandujar/elasticpwn/blob/39805c5246cd56f38f42b82bd58c031b55fec3da/CVE-2015-3337.py","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2015/CVE-2015-3337.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2015-3337_1.yaml","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2015-3337"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0002","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3310","title":"Paul's PPP Package (ppp) rc_mksid 函数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Paul's PPP Package (ppp) 2.4.6 及更早版本中 plugins/radius/util.c 文件的 rc_mksid 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 pppd 进程 PID 大于 65535 时，远程攻击者可通过向 RADIUS 服务器发送特制的 start accounting 消息触发该溢出，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞危害等级中危（CVSS 4.3），影响广泛使用的 PPP 拨号协议实现，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3310"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2015-04-24T14:59:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:42Z","remediation":"升级 ppp 至 2.4.7 或更高版本；如无法升级，可在 RADIUS 客户端配置中禁用记账功能（取消 `radius` 插件加载），或限制 pppd PID 不超过 65535 以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2015-0173.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2015-11/msg00147.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2015/dsa-3228","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2015:222","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74163","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2595-1","https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=782450","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201701-50","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2015/3xxx/CVE-2015-3310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-3310","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2015/UBUNTU-CVE-2015-3310.json","https://github.com/alibaba/AliOS-Things-Linux-Edition/blob/a78f19107de74beaef40b33c9648cf5dadce37e6/meta-yp/meta/recipes-connectivity/ppp/ppp/fix-CVE-2015-3310.patch","https://github.com/ppp-project/ppp/blob/8384435e54cf98fd0dc7bc0399937f1415836d2c/NEWS","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2015-3310.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2015-3310-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-3310.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2015-3310","https://github.com/nobodino/slackware-from-scratch/blob/95d5103c6f93048bdab9debf160b354b10a59f7e/musl/n/ppp/ppp.SlackBuild"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0033","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3035","title":"TP-LINK 多款路由器 目录遍历漏洞","description":"TP-Link 产品目录遍历漏洞是由于 Archer C5、C7、C8、C9、TL-WDR3500、TL-WDR3600、TL-WDR4300、TL-WR740N、TL-WR741ND、TL-WR841N 等多个 TP-Link 系列无线路由器产品在登录功能的路径参数处理中存在输入验证不足的问题。攻击者可以构造包含 \"..\" 目录遍历符号的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径验证访问到 web 根目录之外的敏感文件。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涉及多个 TP-Link 产品型号及版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发。利用该漏洞，攻击者能够读取路由器配置文件、密码文件等系统关键文件，导致敏感信息泄露，严重威胁网络设备安全。 CVSS 评分 7.5，威胁等级为高危，已被 CISA 纳入已知利用漏洞清单。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3035"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-22T01:59:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:09Z","remediation":"建议立即登录 TP-LINK 官网下载并升级至以下固件版本：Archer C5 升级至 150317 或更高版本，Archer C7 升级至 150304 或更高版本，Archer C8 升级至 150316 或更高版本，TL-WDR4300 升级至 150302 或更高版本，TL-WR740N/741ND 升级至 150312 或更高版本，TL-WR841N/841ND 升级至 150310 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 WAN 口对管理界面的访问，或仅允许受信任 IP 访问管理界面作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131378/TP-LINK-Local-File-Disclosure.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Apr/26","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/535240/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74050","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/Archer-C5_V1.20.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/Archer-C7_V2.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/Archer-C8_V1.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/Archer-C9_V1.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WDR3500_V1.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WDR3600_V1.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WDR4300_V1.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WR740N_V5.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WR741ND_V5.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WR841ND_V9.html#Firmware","http://www.tp-link.com/en/download/TL-WR841N_V9.html#Firmware","https://www.sec-consult.com/fxdata/seccons/prod/temedia/advisories_txt/20150410-0_TP-Link_Unauthenticated_local_file_disclosure_vulnerability_v10.txt","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-3035","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3035.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-3035.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/ec725c05eef04e0f0394fb2c948c6268d812dbca/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3035.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2015/3xxx/CVE-2015-3035.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE